<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">Kalatia Mozy</book>
  <para style="h">Kalatia Mozy</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalatia Mozy</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kalatia Mozy</para>
  <para style="mt">Kalatia Mozy</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei, lyuhchâpa Pawla, chyhsa tuapa châ leipa ta, chyhsa zawhzi ta châ hra leipa ta, Zisu Krista nata thina tawhta Zisu a pathyutuhpa Paw Khazohpa zawhzi ta lyuhchâpa rai a hriapa nata
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ei hnohta unawh a ypa zydua ta Kalatia râh liata Awnanopazy eima châ naoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eima Paw Khazohpa nata Abeipa Zisu Krista tawhta ngiachhiena nata thlalôhna nama hnohta y mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ano cha eima Khazohpa nata eima Paw khozie hawhta, tahmâhlâ khizaw moleina tawhta miah pachha awpa ta, eima moleinazy vyuhpa ta anosasyh â hlâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khazohpa hnohta chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta rônahna y mawh sy! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Krista ngiachhiena zawhzi ta nâmo châ awtuhpa siesaipa ta, thâtihpha hropa lâta thlai nama tlei thlâhpa he, noâh ei tah ngaita!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thâtihpha hropa y vei. Krista thâtihpha panano ta, cha patypamâ a chhuahpazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keimo ta tlyma, vârâh tawhta vâlyuhchâpa tlyma ta eima cha chhopa nata a chakhiapa thâtihpha ama cha vaw chho khiahta cha, cha hawhpa chyhsa cha chhiesapa ta y mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eima rei hapa hawhna khata, tahmâ ei reih chanei heih aw: Nama vaw dao hapa thâtihpha chakhiapa ta, thâtihpha hropa châ vaw chhopa maih cha chhiesapa ta y mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tahmâ he chyhsa apykheina ma ei tlua, Khazohpa apykheina maw? Chyhsa palysa a chhuahpa ma ei châ? Chyhsa palysa ei chhuah khiahta la, Krista chakaotuhpa châ aw va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unawh saih u, thâtihpha ei chhopa kha, chyhsapa thâtihpha châ vei tahpa nama pahno awpa ei khoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chyhsa tawhta ei daopa thâtihpha châ leipa ta, eina pachupa ei thâtihpha châ hra vei, Zisu Krista aluahna ta ei daopa thâtihpha a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zuzy zyhna liata ei y nota ei hrozie nama pahno. Thachahra ta Khazohpa Awnanopa taola na ta, parao ei chhuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zuzy zyhna kyh liata, ei chiheihzy hry liata ei richâhkha hluhpizy hlâta hmasie viapa châ na ta, nâ pathlatuhpazy taozietyhpa châta phahnai a ngiah ngaitapa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Châhrasala Khazohpa ta ei nô chhi liata ei y no tawhta na vaw panano ha ta, a ngiachhiena vâta eina aw haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zenitaizy hry liata a thâtihpha ei chho thei nawpa ta, Khazohpa ta a Sawchapawpa cha palôhtlâh ngaitapa ta kei liata a vaw paluahsa. Kha nona kha ahy hmah a saohiah veih ei na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei hlâta lyuhchâpa a châ tuapazy a hmô awpa ta Zerusale lâ khy hra va na. Arabia râh lâ tlao sie na ta, Dâmaskâ khih lâ ei vaw lie heih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kô thôh khai tawhta, Kephâ a hmô awpa ta Zerusale lâ khy na ta, a hnohta noh hrawh hleipangawh châh na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abeipa unawhpa Zâmie dei leipa cha, lyuhchâpa hropa ahy hmah hmô va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Châ ei cha vaw paphaopa ei he haipa bie châ vei tahpa Khazohpa hmiakô liata bie ei taih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cha hnôhlâ ta Suria nata Silisia râhzy lâ sie na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Krista liata a ypa Zudia râh Awnanopazy ta cha ei hmia chhao na pahno mâh veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Miah a taola tyhpa khata, tahmâ cha parao â chhuah tyhpa ngiapâna bie tlao a chho haw,” tahpa ta chyhsazy reipa rakha dei ama thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chatanachata keima vâta Khazohpa ama palyupalih thei haw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kô hrawh hleipalih a khô tawhta, Titu a chhipa ta, Bânabâ chhaota Zerusale lâ khy heih na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aluahna kyh vâta a khypa châ na ta, hraoleipa liata a vaw râpasuapa tlyma, a râpasua haipa tlyma ei châ lei nawpa ta, Zenitaizy hry liata thâtihpha tlâh ei awkhei tyhpa cha, nôpaw viapazy hnohta ano eih ta ei chho ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ei hnohta a ypa Titu cha, Krikâh chyhsa châ hra sala, chopaw pataisa raruahpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Krista Zisu liata khotalaina eima hneipa mohparu awpa ta, unawh pakheipazy arulâta eima hry liata a vaw ngia ei ta, seichâna lâ miah a chhi awpa amâ chhuahpa vâta, chopawtaina kyh he a vaw ypa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Châhrasala thâtihpha biehmeiseihpa cha nama hnohta a y thlâh thei nawpa ta, buakha chhao âmo cha a ngiarih ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chyhsa peimawhpa hawhta a lâpazy he, ama châna vâta kei liata ananona y hlei vei. Khazohpa cha khôtho lâ alânazie ta pachia vei. Chyhsa peimawhpa hawhta a lâpazy heta na phahnaikhei hlei veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Âlielâta tlao a châ. Chopawtaipazy hnohta thâtihpha chhona rai Pity hnohta pavaosapa a châpa hawhta, chopawtaileipazy hnohta thâtihpha chhona rai ei hnohta pavaosapa a châzie lyuhchâpazy ta ama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chopawtaipazy lyuhchâpa Pity chakaona liata rai a hriapa Khazohpa ta, kei, Zenitaizy lyuhchâpa chakaona liata chhao a hria hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ei hnohta piepa ngiachhiena cha, Awnanopa tôhtlâh ta pachâpa Zâmie nata Kephâ nata Zawhâna zy ta ama pahno nahta, âmo cha chopawtaipazy lâ sie aw ei ta, Bânabâ nata kei cha Zenitaizy lâ sie awpa ta akaona ku chachâh lâ miah ama hlâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dyhchhiepazy a thei awpa deikua miah amâ haw. Cha hmo cha tao ei chhuah tyhpa tlai a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kephâ cha Antiôkâ khih lâ â vy nota, â doleipa ta a ypa vâta hmiadaisâ tlai ta ei chakhia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zâmie tawhta chyhsazy ama vaw tlô hlâta cha, Zenitaizy hnohta pati nie tyh ta, châhrasala ama vaw tlô nahta, chopawtaipa py a chipa vâta, ama hnohta a hlao khoh khao leipa ta â panano haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zu chyhsa hropazy chhao ta ano hâ a lapa ta, phapakheipa ta y hra ei ta, Bânabâ chhao tlai cha ama phapakheina ta a paviasa haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Châhrasala ama hro cha thâtihpha biehmeiseihpa nata â hmie leipa ei hmô nahta, ama zydua hmiakô liata Kephâ hnohta, “Nâ, Zu chyhsa ta, Zuzy hrozie hawhta hro leipa ta, Zenitai hrozie hawhta na hro thlâh ha khiahta cha, kheihtazieta Zenitaizy cha Zuzy hawhta paysa raruah nâ chhuah?” tahpa ta ei chho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keimo cha Zu chyhsa ta a pihpa châ pi ta, Zenitai moleipazy châ ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chatahrasala ryhpa hmotaopazy vâta chyhsa cha thaichâpa ta y leipa ta, Zisu Krista ngiapâna vâ deita ta thaichâpa ta a y, tahpa eima pahno. Chavâta keimo chhao, ryhpa hmotaopazy vâta châ leipa ta, Krista Zisu ngiapâna vâta thaichâpa ta eima y thei nawpa ta, Krista cha eimâ ngiapâ. Ryhpa hmotaopazy vâta ahy hmah thaichâpa ta y thei veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Châhrasala Krista liata thaichâpa ta y awpa eima chhuah nota, keimo chhao cha moleipazy vaw châ ha sih la, Krista cha moleina chakaotuhpa a châ tahna a châ aw ma? Châ bao va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ei phie hapa a sa pathituhpa ei châ khiahta cha, paraotuhpa ei châpa keimasasyh ta a palâsapa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khazohpa lâta ei hroh thei nawpa ta, kei la ryhpa vâta ryhpa liata ei thi haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Krista hnohta khaipâpa ta ei y. Châhrasala ei hroh. A hrohpa deikua cha kei châ khao va na, Krista cha kei liata tlao a hroh. Tahmâ pôhpa ta ei hropa he, kyh na pachâ ta, ei châta anosasyh â hlâtuhpa Khazohpa Sawchapawpa ngiapâna liata a hrohpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khazohpa ngiachhiena cha hraolei pachâsa va na. Ryhpa liata thaichâna a y khiahta cha, Krista cha hraoleipa ta a thipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hy Kalatia mo ahrupa saih u! Ahy ma châ dyu ei? Nama mohmô lia tlai ta, Zisu Krista cha khaipâpa ta a ypa a siapa ta palâsapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />He deita he nâmo tawhta pahno awpa ei khoh: Ryhpa hmotaopazy vâta ma Thlahpa nama to, nama theipa namâ ngiapâpa vâta maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khazia he tlu po ta nama hru tly? Thlahpa ta pathao ei chi ta, sapa ta ma nama pachhâ aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hraoleipa hmo châ tlai sala, hraoleipa liata ma pasa hluhpi nama vaw tao?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nama hnohta Thlahpa châ pietuhpa nata nama hry liata hmonoâhpa taotuhpa ta, ryhpa hmotaopazy vâta ma chazy cha a tao? Thei ei chi ta namâ ngiapâ vâta maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abarahâ thâtih kha pachâ tua u, “Khazohpa a ngiapâ ta, cha ngiapâna cha a siana ta raopa a châ.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chavâta pahno teh u, ngiapâna liata a ypazy, chazy tlai cha Abarahâ sawzy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zenitaizy cha ngiapâna vâta Khazohpa ta thai a pachâsa aw ei tahpa Biehrai ta pahno chhielie ta, “Nâma liata phopi to byhnâ topa ta ama y aw,” tahpa ta Abarahâ hnohta thâtihpha a vaw chho chhielie hapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chavâta ngiapâna liata a ypazy cha, ngiapâpa chyhsa Abarahâ hnohta byhnâ patosapa ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ryhpa hmotaopazy liata a pahniehpa zydua cha, chhiesana ry liata ama y, “Ryhpa châbu liata bie ropa zydua a tao leipa nata a zyh leipa maih cha chhiesapa ta y mawh sy,” tahpa ropa châ tlôh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khazohpa mohmô ta ahy hmah ryhpa vâta thaichâpa y veih ei, tahpa a siapa ta â lâ, “Mosiapa cha ngiapâna ta a hroh aw,” tahpa châ tlôh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ryhpa cha ngiapâna tawhta a puapa châ vei, “Ryhpa a zyhpa cha, ryhpa vâna chata a hroh aw,” tahpa tlao a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tho liata bangiehpa maih cha chhiesapa ama châ,” tahpa ropa hawhta, Krista cha keimo châta chhiesapa ta y ta, ryhpa chhiesana tawhta miah a pachha haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chatanachata Abarahâ châta byhnâ awna cha, Krista Zisu vâta Zenitaizy hnohta vaw tlô aw ta, Thlahpa taihpa cha ngiapâna ta eima hmô thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Unawh saih u, pamosa nawpa ta, chyhsapa taozie ei reih tua aw: Chyhsa taopa biehrai hmahta pa-i hapa cha, phie beih leipa ei ta, baichha beih hra veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bietaizy cha Abarahâ nata a chipathla hnohta taopa a châ. “Chipathlazy hnohta,” tahpa ta chyhsa hluhpi hnohta bie hraipa châ leipa ta, “Na chipathla hnohta,” tahpa ta mopakha a nuapa ta biehraipa châ ta, cha cha Krista a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rei ei chhuahpa cha he he a châ: Biehrai taopa a châ tawhta kô 430 khô lâta a vaw ypa ryhpa heta, Khazohpa ta a vaw pa-i hapa biehrai kha parao leipa ta, bietai chhao aruapa pachâsa vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ryuto râh cha ryhpa vâta topa a châ khiahta cha, bietai vâta topa châ aw vei. Châhrasala Khazohpa ta bie a taih ta, ryuto râh cha Abarahâ hnohta piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, khazia ryhpa he a y? Paraonazy vâta ryhpa he bietaizy liata baichhapa châ ta, bietai chipathla â vy hlâta hmâ awpa a châ. Cha cha vâlyuhchâpazy hmâpa ta lyuhchâpa ku ta pa-ipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lyuhchâpa a y khiahta cha, py kha vyuhpa dei ta lyuhchâna rai hria beih vei. Khazohpa deikua cha pakha a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cha khiahta la, ryhpa ta Khazohpa bietaizy a chakhia ma? Chakhia bao va! Hrona a pie theipa ryhpa piepa a châ khiahta cha, siana chhao cha ryhpa vâta a y thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Châhrasala Khazohpa bietai cha, Zisu Krista ngiapâna vâta, ngiapâtuhpazy hnohta piepa a châ thei nawpa ta, khizaw zydua he moleina liata a tâhpa a châzie Biehrai ta a phuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngiapâna a vaw tlô hlâta cha, ryhpa ry liata patâhpa châ pi ta, ngiapâna a vaw tlô haipa phualuahpa a châ hlâlei patâh chypa eima châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chatanachata ngiapâna vâta thai eima châ thei nawpa ta, ryhpa cha Krista lâta miah chhithatuhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tahmâ deikua, ngiapâna a vaw tlô hapa vâta, ryhpa chhihthana ry liata y khao ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ngiapâna vâta, nama zydua ta Krista Zisu liata Khazohpa sawzy nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Krista liata bâti a châpazy cha, Krista ta a tobipazy nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Krista liata cha, Zu tlyma, Krikâh tlyma y leipa ta; sei tlyma, khotalaipa tlyma y hra leipa ta; chapaw tlyma, chanô tlyma y hra vei. Krista Zisu liata cha, nama zydua ta miakha nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Krista eih nama châ khiahta cha, Abarahâ pathla châ ei chi ta, bietai hawhta ryutotuhpazy nama châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rei ei chhuahpa cha he he a châ: Ryutotuh awpa cha ato ano eih châ hra sala, hawti a châ chhôh cha sei nata a nano hlei vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A paw ta ryu a pie nawpa daihti a raopa a tlô hlâlei cha, vaituhpazy nata mohôhtuhpazy ry liata a y chypa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata keimo chhao, hawti eima châ nota cha, khizaw ryhpa ry liata sei ta eima y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Châhrasala a daihti â vaw ki nahta, Khazohpa ta chanô sapa a Sawchapawpa, ryhpa ry liata a pihpa cha za tuah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawchapawpa châna eima to thei nawpa ta, ryhpa ry liata a ypazy chatlai awpa ta a za tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sawchapaw nama châpa vâta Khazohpa ta a Sawchapawpa Thlahpa cha eima palôh chhôh liata za tuah ta, “Abba! Ei Paw!” tahpa ta a aw tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chavâta sei châ khao leipa chi ta, sawchapaw tlao na châ haw. Sawchapaw na châ khiahta cha, Krista zawhzi ta Khazohpa ryutotuhpa na châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khazohpa nama pahno vei nona kha, ama pizie rai chhao ta khazoh a châ leipazy sei ta y ei chi ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tahmâ cha Khazohpa nama pahno haw. Khazohpa ta a pahnopa nama châ haw tah awpa tlao a châ. Cha hawhta nama châ tawh hmâchhâh ta, kheihtazieta khizaw ryhpa chiehleipa nata phahnai leipa lâ nama kua thlâh heih tly? Ama sei ta y heih awpa ma nama tlaichhai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nohzy, thlazy, daihtizy nata kôzy nama chay tyh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nama châta thazâh ei pahryuh thlâhthli aw tahpa ei chi kaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unawh saih u, nâmo hawhta ei ypa hawhna heta, nâmo chhao kei hawhta y awpa ta ei châ haw ei. Ei chô liata khâpa pei hmah hria veih ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nama hnohta thâtihpha ei cha vaw chho tua no ei kha, sapa chiehleina vâta a châpa nama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ei duahmo kha nâmo châta tymâna châ hra sala, na mohnao leipa ei chi ta, na pasi hra veih ei chi. Khazohpa vâlyuhchâpa hawhta tlao nâ ly ei chi ta, Krista Zisu hawh tlai ta einâ ly ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Namâ lyna zydua kha kheihta a châ khai haw? Tao theipa châ sala, nama mozy chhao taih thaopa ta eina pie khoh aw ei chi tahpa ei pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Biedopa ei cha chhopa vâ ei ta, nama khakhaipa ei vaw châ ha ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama cha pahnie thei nawpa ta phahnai a ngiah ngaita ei ta, châhrasala achhuahna phapa châta châ vei. Âmo châta phahnai namâ ngiah thei nawpa ta, miah pachhaih awpa amâ chhuah chaipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Achhuahna phapa châta la, nama hnohta ei y nota dei châ leipa ta, khatino rai ta phahnai a ngiahpa a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ei saw saih u, Krista lyuna nâmo liata a y hlâlei cha, saw zeih ta ei châ zeih ei hih!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nâmo kyh liata ei nôpo ngaita ta, tahmâ chhao he nama hnohta y ta, ao ki pasâh awpa ei byuh kaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ryhpa ry liata a y khohpa saih u, na chho teh u, ryhpa bie cha nathlie tyh vei ei chi ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hetana heta ropa a châpa kha. Abarahâ ta sawchapaw pano hnei ta, pakha cha seichanô chô liata pih ta, pakha cha khotalaipa chanô chô liata a pihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Seichanô chô liata sawchapaw cha, sapa ryhpa hawhta pih ta, khotalaipa chanô chô liata sawchapaw deikua cha, bietai vâta a pihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chazy cha pakhona a châ: Cha chanôzy cha biehrai miano châ ei ta, miakha cha Sinai tlâh tawhtapa châ ta, sei châ awpa ta saw satuhpa Hâkarâ a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hâkarâ cha Arabia râh liata Sinai Tlâh châ ta, a sawzy chhaota sei ta a ypa ama châpa vâta, tahmâno ta Zerusale vyuhpa ta a duahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chô lâ Zerusale deikua cha, khotalaipa châ ta, ano cha keimo nô a châ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Nâ, saw leipa, Saw a sa beih leipa y, Thaphapa ta y mah y; Nâ, saw a zeih beih leipa, Awh la, rahao mah y! Vahpa a hneipa sawzy hlâta, Yrupa chanô sawzy ama hluh via aw,” tahpa ta ropa hawhta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chavâta unawh saih u, keimo cha Aisika hawhta, bietai sawzy eima châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kha nota sapa ryhpa ta a pihpa ta Thlahpa ryhpa ta a pihpa a taolapa hawhna khata, tahmâ chhao he, cha hawhta a châ lymâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Biehrai ta kheihta a tah? “Seichanô nata a sawchapawpa kha papua teh, seichanô sawchapaw ta khotalaipa chanô sawchapaw ryu a tolâh awpa châ vei,” a tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chavâta unawh saih u, keimo la seichanô chô liata sawzy châ leipa pi ta, khotalaipa chanô chô liata sawzy eima châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khotalaipa ta y awpa ta Krista ta miah papua ha ta, chavâta â ipa ta a duah u la, sei raopaky a ky heih awpa ta a pasaih khao khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pachâ teh u, kei, Pawla heta ei cha chho ei. Chopawtaipa namâ pyh khiahta cha, Krista cha nama châta phahnaina hnei aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahy rai chopawtaipa a pyhpa maih cha, ryhpa bie zydua a zyh paki awpa a châ tahpa ei duakhei heih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nâmo, ryhpa ta thaichâ a chhuahpazy saih u, Krista nata a chhaih ha ei chi ta, ngiachhiena nama paosai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keimo deikua la, Thlahpa zawhzi ta, ngiapâna vâta siana to awpa hnabeiseihpa ta, a ngiatiah leipa ta eima hâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Krista Zisu liata la, chopawtaipa tlyma, chopawtaileipa tlyma, phahnaina hnei veih ei. Kyhpachâna ta rai a hriapa ngiapâna dei he a phahnai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Arâpasuana liata namâ râ pha tyh thlâ bao na ta, biehmeiseihpa zyh lei awpa ta, ahyzy ma châ pakhâ ha ei tly?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cha pasyuna cha nâmo châ awtuhpa tawhta châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thinô chyhta ta viahdie zydua a pathyu tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saizie nanopa a pyh aw veih ei chi tahpa Abeipa liata ei lôh. Châ patypamâtuhpa cha, ahy rai châ sala, hriena â tyh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unawh saih u, kei he chopawtaipa aduakheina bie a chhopa cha vaw châ ha sah la, khazia taolapa ta ei y pyly? Cha hawhta châ sala, kraws vâta tymâna he a y lei awpa tlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Châ patypamâtuhpazy cha âmosasyh ta a chhawh pathlah lâlao ei sala ei khoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unawh saih u, khotalaina hnei awpa ta awpa nama châ. Châhrasala nama khotalaina cha sapa ryhpaohna châta hmâh leipa u la, kyhpachâna ta tlao a chakao raihrie teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Nâma kyh nâ pachâpa hawhta, na vaih kyh na pachâ awpa a châ,” tahpa bie miakha liana heta ryhpa zydua â ki.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nâmo nata nâmo a siepa ta, namâ nie khiahta deikua cha, a vaih teh u. Chataleipatala nâmo nata nâmo ta namâ pahleipadia pathlei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chavâta he bie he rei awpa ei khoh, Thlahpa liata y teh u. Chatanachata sapa aohraohna cha pipatlohsa aw veih ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sapa khona ta Thlahpa a dyuh ta, Thlahpa khona ta sapa â dyuh. Nama tao khohpa hmozy nama tao thei lei nawpa ta, sapa nata Thlahpa cha amâ dyuh tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlahpa chhihthapa ta nama y khiah deikua cha, ryhpa ry liata y veih ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sapa hmotaopazy cha a lâ thlâh ha ta, hezy he a châ: Apatlana, palôh pathaih leina, parâna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />nothlahpa achhyna, dyuthaina, ahaona, ahryuna, hiatliana, pathichhiena, ateina, apananona, achhaihna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />uahvana, sahma parina, niedona nata cha hawhpa lâchhâh hmozy cha, sapa hmotaopazy a châ. Zikyu ei châ râ hapa hawhna ei khata, zikyu ei châ râ heih ei. Cha hawhpa hmo a taotuhpazy cha Khazohpa khinarâh to aw veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thlahpa theilâpa deikua cha, kyhpachâna, thaphana, thlalôhna, daotheina, nôphana, phana, ngâchhihna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />areisina nata asohsina zy a châ. Thlahpa theilâpazy chakhianazie ta ryhpa biepiepa rai y vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Krista Zisu liata a ypazy ta sapa cha a aohraohna nata a khonazy chhaota ama khaipâ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thlahpa ta a hrohpa eima châ khiahta cha, Thlahpa liata y ei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keimo nata keimo a pahao leipa ta, keimo nata keimo a uahva hra leipa ta, a pasâhsapa ta y khah suh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unawh saih u, chyhsa ta moleina a tao hai nota pachhaipa a châ khiahta cha, nâmo, thlahpa chyhsazy ta nônai kawpa ta paduapathi heih teh u. A vaih teh u, chataleipatala nâmo chhao reipasaopa ta nama y pathlei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nama phaohrizy a phaokhei raihriepa ta, Krista ryhpa paki teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khâpa hmah châ tlôh leipa ta, chyhsa peimawhpa hawhta â pachâpa cha, anosasyh a dôveipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chyhsa to ama hmotaopa chyu mohpasia mawh ei sy. Chatanachata mohropa nata a pakho leipa ta, anosasyh a palaikhei nawpa chhâpa a hnei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chyhsa to ta âmo phao chyu phaoh tlôh aw ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bie pachuna a daopa cha, hmo pha to a hmôpa tawhta a pachutuhpa pie hra mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dôpa ta y khah u. Khazohpa cha pasipasawh awpa rimâ châ vei. Chyhsa ta chi a tupa maih, cha tlai cha a hria aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ano sapa châta chi a tupa cha, sapa thina thei hria aw ta; Thlahpa châta chi a tupa cha, chhâzaw hrona Thlahpa thei a hria aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmo pha tao ai khah ei suh u. Eima diathlâ leipa khiahta la, a daihtita liata a thei eima hria aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chavâta rypaohna eima hneipa hawhta, chyhsa zydua chô liata hmopha tao sih la, ngiapâtuhpa chhôhkhazy chô liata tao pachai suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moh tua u, châhnawh laipa hmâpa ta, keima ku tlai ta nama hnohta ei vaw roh hih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sapa hmia pha châ khohpazy ta chopaw pataisa raruah ama châ chhuah tyh. Khâpa vâta hmah châ vei, Krista kraws vâta taola ama tao lei nawpa ta a taopa deita ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chopawtaipazy chhao tlai ta ryhpa bie zyh tlôh leipa ei ta, nama pôhpa liata a palaikhei awpa ama hnei thei nawpa ta, chopaw cha pataisa awpa ama khohpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei deikua la, eima Beipa Zisu Krista kraws dei leipa ta cha, a palaikhei awpa hropa hnei va na. Cha kraws liata khizaw he kei châta khaipâpa ta y ta, kei chhao khizaw châta khaipâpa ta ei y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chopawtaipa ta phahnaina hnei leipa ta, chopawtaileipa chhao phahnaina hnei hra vei. Taopathina deikua cha phahnaina a hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cha ryhpa a zyhpa zydua nata Khazohpa Izarei chô liata thlalôhna nata ngiachhiena y mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tahmâ tawhta la ahy hmahta na patypamâ khao khah sy, ei pôhpa liata Zisu eih ei châna ngianazy phaoh tlôh na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Unawh saih u, Abeipa Zisu Krista ngiachhiena cha nama thlahpa hnohta y mawh sy. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
